# Keep scripts/ operational tools and src/*/test/ regression sources visible.
# In particular, robot_control_pkg/CMakeLists.txt compiles test sources when
# BUILD_TESTING is enabled; do not use blanket *test*, *audit* or scripts/ rules.
# Existing tracked files are NOT removed from Git by these ignore rules.
